{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_5_level_main_05-01_end",
  "groupId": "main_5",
  "stageId": "main_05-01",
  "title": "冤家易結",
  "storyCode": "5-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "92a042f4cabad668cf2e8858c8f6857610da3990ac98fa2a3725933ef1501ccf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（后）\n07:55 A.M    天氣/陰\n龍門接舷區，落蹄州，羅德島七號艙室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "在本小姐和羅德島的接應下，阻撓你們的整合運動潰散了，而你的小隊相對保持了完整。哼哼，你總算可以回龍門了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "在你覺得事情告一段落了的時候，你正面吃了一發爆炸，昏了過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "你是想問“你因為被人偷襲昏了過去”是不是真的，還是想問“你被爆炸正面掀翻在地卻僅僅只是昏了過去”是不是真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "算了，別扯了。現在龍門的整體狀況呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "一團糟，具體的自己去看簡報。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "不管之前發生了什麼事，我們反攻的整體進度已經被你拖慢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "現在，特別督察組應該調集近衛局的殘餘隊伍，和羅德島一同向近衛局出發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "一路深入上城區嗎。機動作戰？似乎確實能起到效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "只不過這樣的作戰有什麼意義？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "沿路搗毀所有的整合運動據點。我們會接手你們建立的優勢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "攻堅戰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "沒錯，趁整合運動還沒立足腳跟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "但是，摧毀據點之後，幹道樞紐周邊殘餘的整合運動會迅速合流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你根本不能保證你能堅持到我們奪回近衛局，更別說是在這之後清剿散佈各處的整合運動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我們並不需要你所謂的“建立優勢”，我也不需要你來教我制訂計畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "那可由不得你，陳警司，就算你是特別督查組組長、在戰時擁有特別調遣權及現場執行權，你也不可能逃避所有責任的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "聽你的語氣，你是想挑戰我。這當然可以，但不是現在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我們肩負著不同的使命，我們該做的只是執行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "陳警司，近衛局失守了，整個近衛局大樓都被整合運動控制著，這是你的錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "當龍門需要你的時候，你為什麼不在龍門？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "這也是你接到的命令？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "沒有你的擅離職守，龍門不會失陷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "我替你感到羞恥，陳警司。你該馬上辭職，而我會接管特別督查組。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
